# Seated Together
# ----------------
# A bus has 100 seats arranged in 20 rows with 5 seats in each row.
# Chef sits in seat X and Chefina sits in seat X + 1.
# They can talk only if both seats are in the same row.
#
# Observation:
# - Every row ends at seat numbers that are multiples of 5.
# - If X is a multiple of 5, then X is the last seat of a row,
#   and X + 1 is the first seat of the next row.
# - Otherwise, both seats belong to the same row.

# Read Chef's seat number
x = int(input())

# Check if Chef's seat is the last seat in a row
if x % 5 == 0:
    # Chefina is in the next row
    print("No")
else:
    # Both seats are in the same row
    print("Yes")
